39
00:03:18.709 --> 00:03:25.631
Using shared criteria turns a preference into
a defensible technical choice.

40
00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:33.477
Apply Word Puzzles and String Processing to a
worked situation instead of treating it as an

41
00:03:33.477 --> 00:03:34.445
