48
00:04:02.851 --> 00:04:07.914
The worked case shows both how to apply the
method and how to check it.

49
00:04:08.042 --> 00:04:14.580
Examine the tradeoffs in Algorithmic Paradigms
and Data Structures, including what improves

50
00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:17.304
