controls the outcome.

58
00:05:00.935 --> 00:05:05.216
Recurrences describe the cost of recursive
algorithms.

59
00:05:05.216 --> 00:05:12.670
Consider this worked case: A word puzzle
solver might prioritize common letters first,

60
00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:18.403
